{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46827","headline":"江寺春残寄幕中知己二首 二 · 齐己","name":"江寺春残寄幕中知己二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"社莲惭与幕莲同，岳寺萧条俭府雄。\n冷淡独开香火里，殷妍行列绮罗中。\n秋加玉露何伤白，夜醉金缸不那红。\n闲忆遗民此心地，一般无染喻真空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}